    _root_.GlobalTheory.GaloisLBDescent.lbIso_of_galoisCover S S₁ Y π₁ Ga ρ₁ f (G2 o'.A) (G2 o.A) (G2 u.A) m₁.φ₂ φ₂ PA PB o'.P hA₂ hG c₁ c₂ o'.isLB m₁.pol pol₂
